cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "timeseries-forecasting-benchmark: ML time series forecasting for water and environment"
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "DHI A/S"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible benchmark comparing forecasting methods, from naive baselines to time
  series foundation models, across open water and environment datasets spanning DHI's
  domains (hydrology, urban drainage, water distribution, wastewater, storm surge, waves,
  coastal ocean). Developed under research outcome RK2026 / KER 5 (next-generation modelling).
license: MIT
